  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "ZineLabel",
      "text": "PRINT LAB / FICTIONAL WORKED EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "TRY A MARK"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "A small printmaking experiment"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineIndex",
      "text": "Collage illustration / your prints go on loose paper."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Make two prints from one foam plate. Change one condition, compare them and choose a next test. Work on…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Theme: an everyday trace"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Choose one familiar shape. Predict one feature of its reversed print."
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "Adult beginner / Self-paced. Allow about 30–45 minutes plus drying; estimate untested."
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineIndex",
      "text": "01 Start / 02 Set up / 03 Design / 04 Prepare 05 Proof / 06 Retry / 07 Compare / 08 Next"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLabel",
      "text": "PRINT LAB / FICTIONAL WORKED EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "SET UP"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLead",
      "text": "A small plate. A clear table."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Gather a pre-cut foam printing plate about 2.5 inches square, a pencil, washable marker, small water…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Before starting, check the materials with a facilitator if you are unsure. Test pencil pressure on a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "Choose a comfortable grip and position. A partner may press the plate while you choose the design and…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "Use supplies as labelled. Wash hands after making. Keep the plate and offcuts away from small children…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "My chosen setup or support:"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLabel",
      "text": "PRINT LAB / FICTIONAL WORKED EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "DESIGN"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLead",
      "text": "Choose one shape and one difference."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Sketch a simple ring with a notch on one side, or choose another familiar shape. Leave room around the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Prediction: where will the notch appear in the print? Say or mark your answer before turning to the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Design focus: an everyday trace"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "Draw your idea here. Make the actual plate on separate material."
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLabel",
      "text": "PRINT LAB / FICTIONAL WORKED EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "PREPARE"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLead",
      "text": "Indent the line; keep the surface."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use your sketch as a guide. Press the pencil into the foam to make the main lines. Go over them gently…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Check your prediction: a notch on the left of the plate appears on the right of the print. The raised…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "Look and feel: is the line distinct without a hole? If not, adjust one short section before adding…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "One feature I expect to see:"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLabel",
      "text": "PRINT LAB / FICTIONAL WORKED EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "FIRST PROOF"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLead",
      "text": "Transfer once, then look closely."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Colour the raised surface with washable marker. Lightly mist the plate so it is evenly damp, not…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Label the loose print A. Record one visible feature: edge, pale area, doubled line or missing mark.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "If transfer is faint, check marker coverage and moisture. If it smears, consider excess water or…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Print A — what I can see:"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLabel",
      "text": "PRINT LAB / FICTIONAL WORKED EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "CHANGE ONE"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLead",
      "text": "Make a test you can explain."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Choose one condition to change: marker coverage, water amount or pressing steadiness. Keep the plate,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "I will change __________ because __________. I will keep __________ the same."
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "More water is not always better: excess can blur detail. A faint print does not automatically mean the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Print B — change and observation:"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLabel",
      "text": "PRINT LAB / FICTIONAL WORKED EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "COMPARE"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLead",
      "text": "Look for evidence, not a winner."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Fictional worked example: print A has pooled colour around a ring. The maker uses less water for B and…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Compare your A and B. Which visible feature changed? Which stayed similar? How does that support, or…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "Check: name the changed condition, point to a visible feature, and propose one further trial. If you…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "My comparison and next test:"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLabel",
      "text": "PRINT LAB / FICTIONAL WORKED EXAMPLE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "CARRY IT ON"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineLead",
      "text": "Same principle. A new subject."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Choose a different simple subject and predict its reversed print. Make one new trial later, applying…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Next subject: __________ My prediction: __________ The evidence I will look for: __________"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "Reset: let work dry, wipe the protected surface and clean supplies according to their labels. Keep the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "No learner results have been supplied. Fill the open records from your own making."
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "Read pages 1–8 in order. For a folded copy, use the separate imposition study and its paper-test…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Method references"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "Getty: Printmaking with Washable Markers"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineNote",
      "text": "National Gallery of Art: Storytelling With Prints"
    },
    {
      "style": "ZineIndex",
      "text": "Original instructions and AI-generated collage by Studio Templates. No source-site artwork copied."
    }
